## Semantic Network Implementations

* WikiData

- @Definition@: **WikiData** is a free, collaborative knowledge base for Wikipedia
  (2014) `#cite("vrandecic2014wikidata")`{=typst}
  - Accessible via SPARQL APIs
  - Graph-based data model

::: columns
:::: {.column width=50%}

- @Components@:
  - _Item_: entity (e.g., `Q42` = Douglas Adams)
  - _Property_: attribute (e.g., `P31` = instance of)
  - _Value_: data via property
    - `Q42` $\to$ `P31` $\to$ `Q5` (is human)
    - `Q42` $\to$ `P106` $\to$ sci-fi writer
  - _Reference_: citation
  - _Qualifier_: context (e.g., year)

- @Applications@: KGs, semantic search, AI reasoning

::::
:::: {.column width=50%}

```graphviz
digraph WikiDataStructure {
    rankdir=TD;
    node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=Helvetica];
    edge [fontname=Helvetica];

    q42 [label="Item: Q42\n(Douglas Adams)", fillcolor="#FFD1A6"];
    p31 [label="Property: P31\n(instance of)", fillcolor="#A0D6D1"];
    q5 [label="Value: Q5\n(Human)", fillcolor="#A6E7F4"];

    p106 [label="Property: P106\n(occupation)", fillcolor="#A0D6D1"];
    q36180 [label="Value: Q36180\n(Sci-fi writer)", fillcolor="#A6E7F4"];

    ref [label="Reference:\nSupporting citation", fillcolor="#B2E2B2", shape=note];
    qual [label="Qualifier:\nYear = 1952", fillcolor="#B2E2B2", shape=note];

    q42 -> p31 [label="statement"];
    p31 -> q5 [label="value"];

    q42 -> p106 [label="statement"];
    p106 -> q36180 [label="value"];

    p31 -> ref [label=""];
    p106 -> qual [label=""];
}
```

::::
:::

* DBPedia

- @Definition@: **DBpedia** extracts structured content from Wikipedia, creating a
  large-scale, multilingual knowledge graph (2015)
  `#cite("lehmann2015dbpedia")`{=typst}

::: columns
:::: {.column width=70%}

- @Components@:
  - Data as RDF triples _(Subject, Predicate, Object)_
  - E.g., "Berlin" linked with `dbo:country Germany`, `dbo:populationTotal 3.5M`

- @Applications@:
  - Enables semantic queries over Wikipedia via SPARQL endpoints
  - Semantic Web
  - Enhancing AI models with real-world knowledge

::::
:::: {.column width=30%}

